# Repo-owned typography exemptions, read alongside the managed
# .typography-allow. Path prefixes, one per line, relative to the repo root.
#
# natural-writing documents and detects the look-alike characters themselves
# (em dashes, curly quotes, ellipses appear as quoted examples and inside
# grep patterns), so its files must contain them literally.
skills/natural-writing/
# Local dogfood installs of this repo's own skills (gitignored, never in CI
# checkouts, but local runs of the check scan them).
.agents/
